{% include "grounding_rules.j2" %}

TASK: Write Section {{ section_id }}: {{ section_title }}.
Target Length: {{ target_words }} words

SECTION DETAILS:
- Topic: {{ section_title }}
{% if brief.implementation.is_hardware or brief.domain in ['EMBEDDED_HARDWARE', 'EMBEDDED_IOT'] %}
- Microcontroller: {{ brief.implementation.board.mcu_part_number }} ({{ brief.implementation.board.name }})
{% else %}
- Platform / Environment: {{ brief.implementation.board.name }} ({{ brief.implementation.board.mcu_part_number }})
{% endif %}
{% if brief.implementation.libraries %}
- Framework & Tools: {{ brief.implementation.framework }}, {{ brief.implementation.libraries | join(', ') }}
{% else %}
- Framework & Tools: {{ brief.implementation.framework }}
{% endif %}
{% if brief.implementation.components %}
- System Subsystems:
{% for c in brief.implementation.components %}
  - {{ c.name }}: {{ c.role }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
{% if brief.implementation.pins and (brief.implementation.is_hardware or brief.domain in ['EMBEDDED_HARDWARE', 'EMBEDDED_IOT']) %}
- Pins:
{% for p in brief.implementation.pins %}
  - {{ p.pin }}: {{ p.peripheral }} connected to {{ p.connected_to }} ({{ p.function }})
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

TASK INSTRUCTIONS:
- Write ONE concise introductory paragraph specifically introducing the scope and technical purpose of {{ section_title }}. DO NOT repeat or echo the abstract.
- Then provide 4 to 6 comprehensive, formal bullet points detailing specific aspects of {{ section_title }}.
Output strictly JSON: {"paragraphs": ["Concise introductory statement specific to {{ section_title }}..."], "bullets": ["Technical point 1...", "Technical point 2...", "Technical point 3...", "Technical point 4..."]}
